    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d323">

                <pb facs="0453" n="373" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg373"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Swenson to Mr.
                            Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-06-06"><hi rendition="#italic">June 6,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 261.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                        cablegram<anchor n="a" xml:id="d323-f1"/> of the 21th ultimo.</p>
                <p>In reply to a request which I addressed to the foreign office, under date of the
                    26th ultimo, the minister of foreign affairs informs me, in a note of the 3d
                    instant, that the Danish Government grants the desired permission.</p>
                <p>I have so notified our consular officers in Denmark proper and in the Danish West
                    Indies.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Laurits S.
                    Swenson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
